{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "02055",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.63,
      "end_seconds": 6.87,
      "duration_seconds": 6.24,
      "text": "Uh, doctor? Hello, I hope this is the right time."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 8.21,
      "end_seconds": 12.59,
      "duration_seconds": 4.38,
      "text": "Not at all, please sit. What seems to be wrong?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 13.75,
      "end_seconds": 19.38,
      "duration_seconds": 5.63,
      "text": "So the thing is, I've got a red swollen foot."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 21.14,
      "end_seconds": 22.75,
      "duration_seconds": 1.61,
      "text": "when did this begin?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 24.09,
      "end_seconds": 26.77,
      "duration_seconds": 2.68,
      "text": "For ten days, I'd say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 27.67,
      "end_seconds": 30.93,
      "duration_seconds": 3.26,
      "text": "How much trouble does it give you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 32.97,
      "end_seconds": 40.5,
      "duration_seconds": 7.53,
      "text": "I'd call it moderate. I've also had an ulcer under the big toe, for five days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 44.89,
      "end_seconds": 51.06,
      "duration_seconds": 6.17,
      "text": "have you had a red swollen foot before, or is this the first time?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 51.81,
      "end_seconds": 56.58,
      "duration_seconds": 4.77,
      "text": "I had a similar thing last winter. It went away"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 58.39,
      "end_seconds": 60.58,
      "duration_seconds": 2.19,
      "text": "any sign of black skin?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 61.62,
      "end_seconds": 63.64,
      "duration_seconds": 2.02,
      "text": "definitely no black skin"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 64.55,
      "end_seconds": 69.41,
      "duration_seconds": 4.86,
      "text": "did you get tracking redness, pain in the foot or fever?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 70.9,
      "end_seconds": 77.75,
      "duration_seconds": 6.85,
      "text": "Erm, no tracking redness, pain in the foot or fever, none of it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 79.78,
      "end_seconds": 83.97,
      "duration_seconds": 4.19,
      "text": "What about your tummy and bowels, anything unusual there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 89.86,
      "end_seconds": 92.74,
      "duration_seconds": 2.88,
      "text": "no, that side's been fine"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 97.46,
      "end_seconds": 100.56,
      "duration_seconds": 3.1,
      "text": "has anyone ever diagnosed you with something?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 102.39,
      "end_seconds": 103.77,
      "duration_seconds": 1.38,
      "text": "I've got diabetes"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 104.74,
      "end_seconds": 110.58,
      "duration_seconds": 5.84,
      "text": "Have you got any known allergies? It helps to be thorough at this stage."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 112.22,
      "end_seconds": 115.63,
      "duration_seconds": 3.41,
      "text": "No, nothing as far as I know."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 117.3,
      "end_seconds": 120.49,
      "duration_seconds": 3.19,
      "text": "a few questions about your lifestyle now"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 126.28,
      "end_seconds": 143.62,
      "duration_seconds": 17.34,
      "text": "I used to drink heavily but I stopped four years ago. I have about eight cigarettes in a day. Yes, I work in a bakery, early starts. Not much, I mostly stay in these days"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 145.13,
      "end_seconds": 147.39,
      "duration_seconds": 2.26,
      "text": "anything surgical in your history?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 148.82,
      "end_seconds": 153.95,
      "duration_seconds": 5.13,
      "text": "yes, I had a varicose vein procedure, last year"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 161.81,
      "end_seconds": 166.24,
      "duration_seconds": 4.43,
      "text": "can you list what you take, tablets, creams or inhalers?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 167.52,
      "end_seconds": 170.65,
      "duration_seconds": 3.13,
      "text": "I'm on metformin, twice a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 174.21,
      "end_seconds": 176.63,
      "duration_seconds": 2.42,
      "text": "And what strength is that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 178.11,
      "end_seconds": 187.99,
      "duration_seconds": 9.88,
      "text": "500 milligrams, I think that's what's on the the box. I, I used to take glimepiride, but I stopped it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 198.42,
      "end_seconds": 201.69,
      "duration_seconds": 3.27,
      "text": "I'll note down your vital signs first"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 214.03,
      "end_seconds": 217.34,
      "duration_seconds": 3.31,
      "text": "Okay, keep your arm relaxed for me..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 228.83,
      "end_seconds": 243.37,
      "duration_seconds": 14.54,
      "text": "Okay: weight 54 kilos, height 172 centimetres. And temp 38.3 degrees, heart rate 98, SpO2 96 percent on room air, BMI works out to to 18.3, BP is 124 over 67."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 245.17,
      "end_seconds": 246.8,
      "duration_seconds": 1.63,
      "text": "is that okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 248.53,
      "end_seconds": 251.4,
      "duration_seconds": 2.87,
      "text": "we'll look at it together shortly"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 254.2,
      "end_seconds": 258.18,
      "duration_seconds": 3.98,
      "text": "let me look at the area, I'll be gentle"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 259.58,
      "end_seconds": 262.43,
      "duration_seconds": 2.85,
      "text": "Take a deep breath for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 270.91,
      "end_seconds": 278.56,
      "duration_seconds": 7.65,
      "text": "The ulcer is deep to the fat with surrounding redness and the foot pulses are present."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 283.21,
      "end_seconds": 285.61,
      "duration_seconds": 2.4,
      "text": "you can sit up now"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 300.82,
      "end_seconds": 314.04,
      "duration_seconds": 13.22,
      "text": "Let me tell you where I've got to. It points towards an infected diabetic foot ulcer. The reason I say that is that your story and my examination fit together."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 315.33,
      "end_seconds": 321.03,
      "duration_seconds": 5.7,
      "text": "Sorry, what was I saying, is there something to worry about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 322.46,
      "end_seconds": 335.86,
      "duration_seconds": 13.4,
      "text": "It's reasonable to be concerned, but right now an infected diabetic foot ulcer is my leading thought, not anything worse. Let's get an X-ray of the foot, for possible osteomyelitis."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CLINICAL_STAFF",
      "start_seconds": 340.13,
      "end_seconds": 342.78,
      "duration_seconds": 2.65,
      "text": "The earliest is Tuesday, 9 am."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 343.99,
      "end_seconds": 370.45,
      "duration_seconds": 26.46,
      "text": "Let's book a wound swab to look into infected ulcer. You'll be taking co-amoxiclav, 625 milligrams, three times a day, seven days. You take it by mouth. That's for infected ulcer. Keep the weight off the foot and keep the dressing dry. I'd like you to see the diabetic foot clinic as well, and I'll write the referral. Let's plan a check in two days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 371.75,
      "end_seconds": 373.91,
      "duration_seconds": 2.16,
      "text": "Okay, I'll arrange it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 374.83,
      "end_seconds": 380.26,
      "duration_seconds": 5.43,
      "text": "Right, that's the plan. Do you want to to ask me anything?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 381.01,
      "end_seconds": 384.46,
      "duration_seconds": 3.45,
      "text": "good, thanks, I'll see you then"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 385.72,
      "end_seconds": 387.48,
      "duration_seconds": 1.76,
      "text": "have a good day"
    }
  ]
}